silm:instances_papers_25_sheaf_gluing_chapters_01_sheaf_basics_local_sections_sections_01_site_of_mittens_history_concrete_anchor_4#vetowneroverlap1window silm:hasLongDescription "The VetOwnerOverlap1Window is the half-day of June 3rd that is both inside the vet-visit window and inside the household-log span. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'U_{vet1} cap U_{owner1}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
